  <page_number>287</page_number>
  <running_head>EPIGRAM. A. FAYI.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Montes, mille greges cornigerûm boum</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Qui pastos alius per iuga pinguia,</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Plenis beribus nectar lacteo:</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Pastorum dominum toilite laudibus</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Præbentem pecori gramina commoda.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Valles contiguæ montibus herbidis,</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Lympharum veluti dote perennium,</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Et roris fluido fumine fertiles,</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Factura innumerum lanigerum pecus,</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Laudes munifico psallite numini.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Saltus, sylua, nemus, quicquid &amp; arborum,</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Florum quicquid &amp; est, omnéque stirpium,</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">Seu notum fuerit, seu minimè, genus;</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Florenti Iehouam carmine pangite.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Impastæ, saturæ, foliuagæ feræ,</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Assuetæ stabulis, quæque per aëra</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">Alæ præcipitis remigio volant,</l>
    <l n="18" para="true">Vndarum liquidas quæque secant vias</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">Vna compositis vndique vocibus,</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">Sanctæ ferte Deo cantica gloriæ.</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">Et tu, cæruleo fluore lætos</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Inuitans oculos, trahénsque lapsu</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">Aures &amp; strepero meas susurro:</l>
    <l n="24" para="true">Qui celsa veniens ab Alpe, nusquam</l>
    <l n="25" para="true">Siltis, donec aquis tuis vetustam</l>
    <l n="26" para="true">(A quâ nomen habes) Rhodam salutes:</l>
    <l n="27" para="true">Non fluxam cane gloriam potentis,</l>
    <l n="28" para="true">Qui terras &amp; aquas ligat, parentis.</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">Paruis, VRA, cadens rapax scatebris,</l>
    <l n="30" para="true">Et valles nemoris lauans propinqui,</l>
    <l n="31" para="true">Dans vrsis &amp; apris sitis leuamen</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Verse lines are printed as one line each; I marked paragraphs by stanza. Line-end hyphens are absent in the scan. Some words in the scan are blurred, notably "Iehouam", "Alpe" and "Siltis", and may need checking against the original.</notes>
